# Frontend Structure (PPL-C5)

## Key Directories

- **[src/app](mdc:PPL-C5/src/app)**: Next.js app directory with pages and routes
- **[src/components](mdc:PPL-C5/src/components)**: Reusable UI components
- **[src/modules](mdc:PPL-C5/src/modules)**: Feature-specific modules
- **[src/hooks](mdc:PPL-C5/src/hooks)**: Custom React hooks
- **[src/lib](mdc:PPL-C5/src/lib)**: Utility functions and libraries

## Main Files

- **[package.json](mdc:PPL-C5/package.json)**: Project dependencies and scripts
- **[next.config.ts](mdc:PPL-C5/next.config.ts)**: Next.js configuration
- **[middleware.ts](mdc:PPL-C5/src/middleware.ts)**: Next.js middleware for authentication

## Entry Points

- **[src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:PPL-C5/src/app/layout.tsx)**: Root layout component
- **[src/app/page.tsx](mdc:PPL-C5/src/app/page.tsx)**: Homepage component
